  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/titles/bigger_stack_size.png\" alt=\"minecraft datapack bigger stack size mod custom stack size mod\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/z2n3qTzQY6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/Discord.png\" alt=\"jodeks discord - discord badge - pixel badge - pixel discord badge - jodeks datapacks - datapacks discord\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/YouTube.png\" alt=\"datapacks jodek youtube\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Bigger-Stack-Size/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/GH_Issues.png\" alt=\"armor stand arms minecraft datapack github issues\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/Kofi.png\" alt=\"jodeks datapacks kofi - jodek kofi - minecraft datapack kofi donation\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/Jodekq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/GH_Sponsor.png\" alt=\"github sponsor jodek donation datapacks minecraft\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>所有物品默认可堆叠至 64 个，当它们进入你的背包时会自动更新。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>原本只能堆叠至 1 或 16 的物品，现在均可堆叠至 64 个。</strong></p>\n<h2>配置</h2>\n<pre><code>/trigger bigger_stack_size.config</code></pre>\n<p>如果在配置中禁用此功能，当你在背包中拆分物品时，堆叠数量将重置。</p>\n<h2>选择哪些物品可堆叠</h2>\n<p>编辑以下文件：</p>\n<pre><code>datapack/bigger_stack_size/tags/item/stackable.json</code></pre>\n<h2>使特定物品暂时不可堆叠（例如用于物品分拣器）：</h2>\n<p>使用铁砧将物品命名为“unstackable”。</p>\n<h2>更新来自 1.21.6 以下版本的物品</h2>\n<pre><code>/trigger bigger_stack_size.update_items</code></pre>\n<p>更新你背包中的所有物品。请确保不要拥有自定义数据且你不希望丢失的物品（例如来自其他数据包的数据）。</p>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fcjL4vdu4QBQ\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/cjL4vdu4QBQ</a> </span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2>可堆叠物品列表</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>盔甲架</li>\n<li>旗帜图案</li>\n<li>旗帜</li>\n<li>床</li>\n<li>船</li>\n<li>蛋糕</li>\n<li>携带箱子的船</li>\n<li>唱片</li>\n<li>空桶</li>\n<li>空潜影盒</li>\n<li>鸡蛋</li>\n<li>末影珍珠</li>\n<li>附魔书（下一版本更新）</li>\n<li>蜂蜜瓶</li>\n<li>悬挂告示牌</li>\n<li>滞留药水</li>\n<li>矿车</li>\n<li>药水</li>\n<li>鞍</li>\n<li>告示牌</li>\n<li>雪球</li>\n<li>喷溅药水</li>\n<li>炖菜</li>\n<li>不死图腾</li>\n<li>望远镜</li>\n<li>书与笔</li>\n<li>牛角</li>\n<li>马铠</li>\n</ul>\n<p>--&gt; <strong>以上所有物品均可堆叠至 64 个。</strong></p>",
